<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae sees 12 bln esc extraordinary cons net 1996.</title>
<headline>Sonae sees 12 bln esc extraordinary cons net 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese industrial group Sonae Investimentos said it expected its 1996 consolidated extraordinary profit to be about 12 billion escudos, above a forecast in September of a 5.6 billion escudos profit.</p>
<p>Sonae Investimentos made an extraordinary profit of 8.3 billion escudos in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
